# Everything here runs under WSL2/Linux (see README prerequisites), so
# shell scripts and other executables must never be checked out with CRLF —
# Git for Windows' default core.autocrlf=true will otherwise silently break
# every "#!/usr/bin/env bash" shebang.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
CMakeLists.txt text eol=lf
config.cfg text eol=lf
